@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "Отправитель" as Sender
participant "WebSocket Gateway" as GW
participant "Chat Service" as Chat
database "PostgreSQL shard\n(messages + outbox)" as DB
participant "Outbox Publisher" as Outbox
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Delivery Worker" as Worker
participant "Presence / Redis" as Presence
participant "WebSocket Gateway\nполучателя" as ReceiverGW
participant "Push Service" as Push
participant "APNs / FCM" as Provider

Sender -> GW : send_message(chat_id, client_message_id, text)
GW -> Chat : проверить сессию и лимиты
Chat -> DB : BEGIN; INSERT message + outbox; COMMIT
DB --> Chat : commit подтверждён
Chat --> GW : message_accepted(message_id, message_seq)
GW --> Sender : ACK

Outbox -> DB : получить не опубликованные события
DB --> Outbox : MessageAccepted(event_id, chat_id, message_id)
Outbox -> Kafka : publish (idempotent event_id)
Kafka -> Worker : consume MessageAccepted
Worker -> DB : прочитать сообщение (по message_id)
Worker -> Presence : найти gateway_id участников
Presence --> Worker : online devices / offline devices
Worker -> ReceiverGW : realtime message.new
ReceiverGW --> Worker : enqueue/write result
Worker -> Kafka : push-task для offline devices
Kafka -> Push : consume push task
Push -> Provider : отправить push notification
Provider --> Push : accepted / retryable error

note over Chat,DB
  Сообщение и outbox фиксируются
  одной транзакцией. ACK только после commit.
end note
note over Kafka,Push
  At-least-once: возможны повторы.
  Consumers дедуплицируют по event_id/message_id.
end note
@enduml
